    "turn_text": "Hey, this is CW. Thank you so much for checking out this podcast here on corncountry.com. The other day, we had the great honor of having the US representative of Indiana's 9th Congressional District, Trey Hollingsworth, stopped by the Corn Country Studios. We talked about a number of things, including this thing called the Local Radio Freedom Act, which you'll learn about here in just a little bit. We also delved into what's going on here in Johnson County with Camp Atterbury. So let's dive into that conversation right now with Representative Trey Hollingsworth. Well, Trey, welcome to the Corn Country Studio. So nice to see you and welcome.",
