    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/6/86305.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "Well, look, this is an important step in making sure that we continue to protect our local radio stations, which are the lifeblood of so many communities. It's how people find out what's going on in their communities, how people find out the news in their communities, how they find out all of the things that there are to do in their communities. And I want to make sure that I continue to stand with our local broadcasters and empower them to continue to help their communities, to continue to guide their communities and continue to support those local communities, because I know so many of our broadcasters are day in and day out.",
