    "turn_text": "i think there's a wide variety of reasons why someone should care about this bill even if they don't work inside the industry they're probably listeners in the industry they're probably advertisers inside the industry it's really important that we make sure that there are a wide variety of outlets for people to be able to get their news especially the news, the personalities, the opportunities, the events that are happening right there locally for them. I think it's really, really important that we continue to support these broadcasters, continue to support a media ecosystem where people can say, gosh, this is my radio station. I click it on every morning when I'm getting ready for work. I click it on every afternoon when I'm headed home for work. I think it's really important that people have access to that local content, that local content that makes their life so much more fulfilled.",
