    "turn_idx": 18,
    "turn_text": "All right, so let's turn our attention to the internet and social media, shall we say, and how that has affected the broadcasting industry through the years, you know, places like Facebook and Twitter. And let's talk a little bit about that. And is it the Journalism Protection Act? What are your thoughts about that?",
