    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/6/86305.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 31,
    "turn_text": "It is really frustrating to me in classic Washington that there's a lot of talk about this, right? There's a lot of fiery speeches about this, but there's very little action. And this is what I push my colleagues on every single day. I am a business guy at heart and businesses are judged not by what they talk about, but by what they do. I want our government to be the same way, judged by what it does to make sure that the lives of Americans are better every single day than they were the day before. and making sure that we push back, especially with a regulatory regime that finally curtails the power that Facebook has is really important to me, not just talk about it up on the Senate floor.",
