    "turn_idx": 46,
    "turn_text": "Look at this administration's abysmal failures time and time again that are uncovered by the media that they don't care to even talk about. And still yet, you turn on MSNBC. I don't particularly turn on it, but I'm sure others do. And they're still talking about Trump, right? They're still talking about Trump as though he's the current president. This is really a shame because I think Americans are tired and frustrated of being fed partisan information and are looking for the ability to get out more information and get their hands on that.",
