    "turn_idx": 67,
    "turn_text": "Well, look, I think there are a wide variety of ways we've seen already some of the local businesses stepping up, not only to donate various things, right, but also to say, look, we have open careers that might be available to those individuals, provided they meet all the background checks, provided they're doing the right things, provided they want to become citizens, they want to be a part of our great society. I think there are a lot of outpouring to support that we've already seen a wide variety of ways. And I know that Hoosiers want to help every way they can, but they just want to make sure that this becomes a part of our fabric, not a stain on our fabric.",
