    "turn_idx": 69,
    "turn_text": "Gosh, that's such a great question. I tell you what, this is the thing I go everywhere and talk about from elementary schoolers all the way up to senior citizens in our homes around here, which is this is our government. This is government by the people for the people. I work for you. We have the office that's right here in Franklin. Come see us if you have a problem. Come see us if there's an issue you're passionate about. Come see us if there's something you want us to start working on. Come see us if there's something you want us to stop working on. I want to make sure that your voice is heard in Washington DC, that your values are represented in Washington DC. I want to make sure this government gets back to working for you. And the best way to do that is to make sure I'm hearing from you. So please reach out to us, make sure that we're focused on your issues.",
